      <title>惠灵顿牛排为什么挑人？一位吃过20多家版本的食客直言它一般人不会觉得好吃</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/%E6%83%A0%E7%81%B5%E9%A1%BF%E7%89%9B%E6%8E%92%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%8C%91%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%8D%E5%90%83%E8%BF%8720%E5%A4%9A%E5%AE%B6%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E7%9A%84%E9%A3%9F%E5%AE%A2%E7%9B%B4%E8%A8%80%E5%AE%83%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E8%A7%89%E5%BE%97%E5%A5%BD%E5%90%83/</link>
